               <title>Inactive ingredients</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>water, dimethicone, isododecane, alcohol denat., trimethylsiloxysilicate, butylene glycol, PEG-10 dimethicone, perlite, synthetic fluorphlogopite, nylon-12, isopropyl lauroyl sarcosinate, diisopropyl sebacate, HDI<content>/trimethylol hexyllactone crosspolymer, </content>
                     <content>disteardimonium hectorite, BIS</content>
                     <content>-PEG/PPG-14/14 dimethicone, </content>
                     <content>magnesium sulfate, </content>
                     <content>aluminum hydroxide, </content>
                     <content>phenoxyethanol, </content>
                     <content>disodium stearoyl glutamate, </content>
                     <content>hydrogen dimethicone, </content>
                     <content>cellulose, </content>
